  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:0",
      "text": "Morning from Berlin. Quick one on the 4.2 release. The build is green and QA signed off last night."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:1",
      "text": "Nice. Is the changelog still a mess?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:2",
      "text": "It's forty raw commit titles. Customers can't read that."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:3",
      "text": "Support wants the notes before the rollout so they can update the help center articles."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:4",
      "text": "Right. Marcus, can you get the release notes to me by end of day tomorrow? I'll review and publish them."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:5",
      "text": "End of day tomorrow works. I'll group them by feature, fixes and deprecations."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:6",
      "text": "Please call out the export change. That one will generate tickets."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:7",
      "text": "Will do. I'll put it at the top with a short how-to."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:8",
      "text": "And the rollout itself starts Thursday at 08:00 my time, ten percent first."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:9",
      "text": "I'll have the help center drafts ready to flip on Thursday."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:10",
      "text": "Do we mention the API rate limit change or keep that for the developer newsletter?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:11",
      "text": "Mention it in one line and link to the developer docs."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:12",
      "text": "Works for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-end-of-day-timezones:seg:13",
      "text": "Great. Thanks, both."
    }
  ],
